>> title: Session Grain Bowl
>> course: lunch
>> servings: 2
>> source: Studio Cooking wiki

Cook @quinoa{150%g} in @water{300%ml} for ~{15%minutes}.

Roast @sweet potato{1} in cubes with @olive oil{1%tbsp} at 200C for ~{25%minutes}.

Build bowls with @spinach{2%handfuls}, @chickpeas{240%g}, the quinoa and sweet potato, and a spoon of @tahini{2%tbsp} thinned with @lemon{1/2}.
